The firstdigits is a list of 7, 2, 4, and 3.
The seconddigits is a list of 5, 6, and 4.
The first is 0.
For each digit in firstdigits.
Set first to first times 10 plus digit.

The second is 0.
For each digit in seconddigits.
Set second to second times 10 plus digit.

The total is first plus second.
The digits is an empty list of whole numbers.
Repeat while total is more than 0.
The digit is total modulo 10.
Place digit into digits.
Set total to total divided by 10.

The last is the last position of digits.
The line is empty text.
For every step from 0 to last.
The spot is last minus step.
If the length of line is more than 0, Place "," into line.
Place format whole number item spot of digits as text into line.

Show line.
